Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:45.00,Brand,,0,0,0,,SANDBOX
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:45.00,Title,,0,0,0,,On utilise encore l'IA comme Google
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:45.00,Footer,,0,0,0,,La discussion complète sur SANDBOX
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Je pense que le problème, c'est
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.33,0:00:02.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,les cas d'usage.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Le jour où il y a
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.50,0:00:04.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,une entreprise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,qui va mettre un milliard dans
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.50,0:00:06.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,sa communication
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,et va te sortir plein de
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.20,0:00:08.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,cas d'usage, elle va
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,démocratiser la technologie qui
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,existe
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.00,0:00:10.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,démocratiser la technologie qui
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.80,0:00:11.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,existe
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.00,0:00:13.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,déjà. On n'est plus sur un
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,problème de
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,technologie. Le problème, c'est
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,l'usage :
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,elle est super puissante, mais
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,99 % des gens ne savent
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,pas quoi en faire
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,et 99 % des gens s'en
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.57,0:00:23.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,servent
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,pour poser des questions comme
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,si c'était Google.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Et c'est là, je pense, le
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,nœud,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,quand on va découvrir tout ce
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,qu'on peut
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,faire. Il y a des gens
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.33,0:00:33.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,qui ont découvert
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,qu'on peut créer un assistant
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.67,0:00:35.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,nutritionnel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.00,0:00:36.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,et il te crée ton programme,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,tes menus,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.00,0:00:38.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,et ta liste de courses. Tu
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.20,0:00:39.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,vois, il y a
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,plein de cas d'usage comme ça,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.50,0:00:41.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,qui parlent
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.00,0:00:43.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,aux gens.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,d'usage comme ça qui parlent aux
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.71,0:00:45.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,gens.
